# Project Proposal

## Project Overview
Project Group 11 will develop a Python application that addresses a practical user need. The specific problem and target users will be defined during the initial research phase.

## Problem and Proposed Solution
The project will identify a task or problem that can be made simpler through software. Based on user needs, the team will design and build a focused, easy-to-use application, then evaluate whether it solves the problem effectively.

## Objectives
- Research the problem and define clear requirements.
- Design and implement the core solution in Python.
- Test functionality, usability, and reliability.
- Document the application and present the final result.

## Plan and Deliverables
Work will proceed through research and planning, design, implementation, testing, and final presentation. Deliverables will include a working application, its source code, relevant documentation, and a demonstration. Team responsibilities and milestone dates will be agreed upon once the project scope is confirmed.

## Success Criteria
The application meets the agreed requirements, performs reliably during testing, and is understandable and useful to its intended users.